@* Unified inline-SVG icon set — Phosphor Icons (regular weight, 256×256 fill).
   Paths vendored from @phosphor-icons/core so the single-file exe needs no CDN.
   Legacy feather-era names are kept as aliases in Normalize().
   Usage: <Icon Name="gauge" /> or <Icon Name="key" Size="18" /> *@

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="@Size" height="@Size" viewBox="0 0 256 256"
     fill="currentColor" class="eg-icon @Class" aria-hidden="true">
    @((MarkupString)Path)
</svg>

